📌 Project Overview

This project analyzes **store distribution and ownership patterns** across different countries and cities.

The dashboard provides an interactive view of store counts based on **country, ownership type, and city**, helping identify how stores are distributed and how different ownership models contribute to the overall store network.

## 🎯 Objectives

* Analyze store distribution across countries.
* Compare different store ownership types.
* Identify cities with a high number of stores.
* Understand the overall store network distribution.
* Present insights through an interactive dashboard.

## 📈 Key Analysis

### 🌍 Country Distribution

The dashboard allows users to explore store information across multiple countries.

### 🏢 Ownership Type

| Ownership Type | Store Count |
| -------------- | ----------: |
| Company Owned  |      11,932 |
| Licensed       |       9,375 |
| Joint Venture  |       3,976 |
| Franchise      |         317 |

Company Owned stores have the highest count, followed by Licensed, Joint Venture, and Franchise stores.

### 🏙️ Top Cities

The dashboard includes an analysis of **Top Cities by Number of Stores**, allowing users to identify locations with a high concentration of stores.

